### ChainSentinel Rule API tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Create PRICE_THRESHOLD rule (ONCE mode by trigger state)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "btc-price-gte-100000",
  "type": "PRICE_THRESHOLD",
  "condition": {
    "version": 1,
    "type": "PRICE",
    "condition": {
      "symbol": "BTC-USDT",
      "op": "gte",
      "threshold": "100000",
      "cooldownSec": 0
    }
  },
  "severity": "HIGH",
  "enabled": true
}

### Create AMOUNT rule (EVENT v1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "eth-amount-gte-1eth",
  "type": "AMOUNT",
  "condition": {
    "version": 1,
    "type": "EVENT",
    "condition": {
      "all": [
        {
          "field": "amount",
          "op": "gte",
          "value": "1000000000000000000"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "severity": "CRITICAL",
  "enabled": true
}

### Manually evaluate PRICE_THRESHOLD rules (no need to wait scheduler)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/rules/price/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{}
